CoffeeNChill Canteen Management System
Part 1 — Azure Functions, Azure Table Storage, Postman & Docker

CoffeeNChill is a canteen management system developed using C# Azure Functions and Azure Storage. Part 1 focuses on creating a REST API for managing menu items, storing menu data in Azure Table Storage, handling staff documents using Azure Files, containerising the application with Docker, and testing the API using Postman.

